ass=\"hover:text-black\">Pricing</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-black\">Pages <span class=\"text-xs\">▼</span></a>\n                </div>\n\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold hover:opacity-70\">\n                    Contact Us\n                    <div class=\"bg-optimo-blue text-white rounded-full p-1 w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"7\"></line><polyline points=\"7 7 17 7 17 17\"></polyline></svg>\n                    </div>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </nav>\n\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 flex-grow flex items-center\">\n            <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-end pb-20\">\n                \n                <div class=\"text-white max-w-2xl\">\n                    <h1 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] mb-6\">\n                        Navigate Business<br>\n                        with <span class=\"font-serif-italic font-normal\">Confidence</span>\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-200 text-lg mb-8 max-w-lg font-light\">\n                        Expert strategic consulting to drive sustainable growth, operational innovation, and lasting business transformation across industries.\n                    </p>\n                    \n                    <button class=\"bg-white text-black pl-5 pr-2 py-2 rounded-full flex items-center gap-3 font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition\">\n                        Book a Free Call\n                        <span class=\"bg-optimo-blue text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"7\"></line><polyline points=\"7 7 17 7 17 17\"></polyline></svg>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl max-w-md ml-auto w-full relative top-12 lg:top-24\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Let's Move Your Business Forward</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-6 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Success doesn't happen by chance—it's built through smart strategy, informed decisions.\n                    </p>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"bg-gray-100 rounded-full p-1.5 pl-5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                        <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\" class=\"bg-transparent text-sm outline-none w-full text-gray-700 placeholder-gray-400\">\n                        <button class=\"bg-optimo-blue text-white w-9 h-9 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 hover:bg-blue-800 transition\">\n                            <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"7\"></line><polyline points=\"7 7 17 7 17 17\"></polyline></svg>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"py-24 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n        \n        <h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-medium leading-tight mb-20 max-w-4xl text-gray-900\">\n            Since 2016, we're a team of all in all <span class=\"font-serif-italic\">experienced</span> consultations, <span class=\"text-gray-400\">combine for strategic instant.</span>\n        </h2>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-end\">\n            \n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-3 flex flex-col justify-between h-full\">\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-12\">\n                    At Optimo, We help businesses navigate complexity unlock to growth achieve lasting transformation with a team of experienced consultations.\n                </p>\n                \n                <div class=\"border-l-4 border-optimo-blue pl-4\">\n                    <span class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 block\">150+</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium\">Successful Projects Delivered</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-5\">\n                <div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden h-[400px]\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-5973dc0f32e7?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop\" \n                         alt=\"Team Meeting\" \n                         class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[20%] hover:scale-105 transition duration-700\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 h-full flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-optimo-blue mb-6\">\n                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"transform -rotate-45\"><path d=\"M16 2l-2.5 4h-3L8 2H6v9H2v2h4v9h2v-9h4l2.5 4h3l-2.5-4h2.5V2z\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n                \n                <ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-10 text-sm font-medium text-gray-800\">\n                    <li>Strategic Planning</li>\n                    <li>Operational Excellence</li>\n                    <li>Market Expansion</li>\n                    <li>Risk Management</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <button class=\"bg-optimo-blue text-white w-full py-3 rounded-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 hover:bg-blue-800 transition group\">\n                    Book a Free Call\n                    <span class=\"bg-white text-optimo-blue w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center group-hover:rotate-45 transition\">\n                        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"7\"></line><polyline points=\"7 7 17 7 17 17\"></polyline></svg>\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"py-20 bg-[#f9f9f9] text-center px-6\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-normal leading-tight text-gray-900 mb-6\">\n                With a <span class=\"font-bold\">98% client</span> <span class=\"font-serif-italic\">satisfaction</span>,<br>\n                our strategies have led to <span class=\"font-bold\">$50M+</span><br>\n                in revenue\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-500 max-w-lg mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                Our strategic approach is designed to align with your business goals, helping you scale faster.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
